            <div xml:id="d683">

                <pb facs="0956" n="854" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg854"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Czechoslovakia/212</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Moley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-05">May 5, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Czechoslovak Minister came to call attention to the fact that no provision
                    had been made in the budget of his country for payment of the June 15th debt
                    installment. He indicated that he would like to have this Government consider
                    deferring the installment at least during the period of the Economic Conference.
                    We did not discuss the question of a permanent settlement. I asked him to keep
                    in touch with me as we discuss the question with other nations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R[<hi rendition="#small-caps">aymond</hi>] M[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >oley</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
